WAYS TO ABUSE FFMPEG INTO AN INSTRUMENT — BRAINSTORM

Ideas, not instructions. ✓ = verified in this studio.

VIDEO → SOUND

- ✓ spectrumsynth as a wavetable organ. Any video source becomes a magnitude
  spectrum: cellauto (rule 30/110), life, mandelbrot zooms, zoneplate, perlin,
  sierpinski, gradients.
- Paint the harmony. Use geq to draw bright horizontal lines at the bin rows of
  a chord's partials, gated by T, so a progression becomes a moving image.
- Text as spectrum. drawtext writes a word into the spectrogram, and the letters
  become formants (Aphex Twin's face trick, run backwards).
- Phase as a separate instrument. Keep the magnitude fixed and animate only the
  phase video: the same spectrum gains roughness, swirl or chorus.
- Video filters as spectral processors. Run boxblur (spectral smear), edgedetect
  (onset sharpening), lagfun (spectral freeze/sustain), tmix (spectral reverb),
  rotate (frequency↔time swap), hflip/vflip (reverse or invert the spectrum),
  xfade (spectral morph) or displace (spectral warping) between a showspectrum
  of one sound and spectrumsynth. This is audio→video→audio inside one graph.
- Chimeras (Hecker). blend the spectrogram images of two sounds: magnitude from
  one, phase from the other.
- Codec damage to a spectrum. Heavy video compression of a spectrogram is
  impossible in a single pass, but noise, pixelize, posterize and dctdnoiz
  imitate it. posterize amounts to spectral quantization.

ENCODERS AND DECODERS AS INSTRUMENTS

- Lossy codecs at absurd settings. Opus at 6 kbps, mp2 at 8k, AAC with tiny
  bandwidth, gsm, adpcm_*, g722, g726 at 2 bits, roq_dpcm, nellymoser. Each
  codec has its own "voice" of failure.
- Bitstream filters as performers. noise=amount=N corrupts packets,
  noise=drop=expr drops packets on a schedule (a rhythm made from packet loss),
  and -bsf setts/pts rewrite time.
- Wrong-codec decode of right-format bytes. Input -f s16le of an mp3 file, -f
  mulaw of a PNG, -f f32be of a font (floats from text are wild).
- Dither and noise-shaping as texture. aresample=dither_method=... at 8-bit
  output, acrusher with its log/lin modes.
- Resampler abuse. aresample with filter_size=1, phase_shift=0, cutoff=0.1
  produces aliasing on purpose; tune the aliasing by choosing the rates.

FOUND BYTES

- ✓ The ffmpeg binary reads itself. Fonts, dylibs, /usr/share/dict/words, the
  downloaded docs and the system's kernel caches can all be read as audio.
- subfile protocol to cut exact byte ranges, so a file can be "played" in loops
  tuned by byte length (loop period = bytes/rate).
- concat: protocol stitches byte ranges into a sequence, so a score of offsets
  is written into the command.
- data: URIs. Claude types waveforms by hand in base64: single-cycle wavetables,
  a drum hit, a microtonal table.
- Endianness and channel-count lies. -ac 7, -f s24be and similar turn structured
  data into polyrhythmic stereo.

THE EXPRESSION ENGINE AS A SYNTHESIZER

- ✓ Persistent variables make recursive DSP possible: oscillators, filters,
  envelopes.
- GENDYN (Xenakis). Breakpoint waveforms whose points random-walk between
  mirrors.
- Chaotic systems: logistic map, Lorenz and Chua attractors as oscillators. Tune
  them by the integration step.
- Physical models. A two-mass spring, a bowed-friction stick-slip, a bouncing
  ball (the Risset rhythm turned physical).
- Pulsar synthesis (Roads). One waveform cycle plus silence, with rhythm and
  pitch on a single control.
- ✓ Closed-form harmony: modes, chords and voice leading in one line.
- aeval as a custom effect: waveshapers, wavefolders, sample-and-hold, bitwise
  ops (bitand/bitor on sample ints = bytebeat).
- Bytebeat inside aevalsrc. t*(t>>5|t>>8) written with floor/bitand, at 8 kHz,
  then resampled.

FILTERS PUSHED PAST THEIR PURPOSE

- aecho with decays ≈ 0.99 gives tuned comb resonators (Karplus-Strong) that
  "play" whatever passes through.
- afir with an IR synthesized in the same graph: a chord as the IR (everything
  becomes that chord), a click train as the IR (rhythmic reverb),
  mandelbrot→spectrumsynth as the IR.
- Lucier's I Am Sitting in a Room. Chain the same afir room 8–16 times with
  normalization; asplit taps after each pass, concatenated as movements.
- afftdn/anlmdn/afwtdn denoisers fed pure noise "hallucinate" tonal residue.
- adynamicequalizer, sidechaincompress and sidechaingate between unrelated
  generators turn one rhythm into another's breathing.
- afreqshift/aphaseshift give inharmonic bells from harmonic sources and
  barber-pole effects.
- headphone/sofalizer/surround/virtualbass/dialoguenhance put the upmixers and
  repair tools to work as instruments.
- asendcmd as the score. Timed parameter changes (chord changes on a resonator
  bank) written as text in the command.
- atempo and asetrate chains at extreme ratios: asetrate=480 then resample gives
  a 100× slowdown and new pitch worlds.
- apulsator, tremolo, vibrato at audio rates become AM/FM synthesis made from
  effect units.

COMPOSITION AND STRUCTURE

- Coprime counters (Autechre): form emerges from patterns of 5, 7, 11 and 13
  steps meeting.
- Barbieri gate scores: a pitch row against a gate row against an octave row.
- Risset/Shepard on any parameter: endless rises in tempo, filter or density.
- Radigue's crossfades: one 10-minute gesture.
- Ikeda's palette: sine, click, noise, silence, data, at threshold frequencies;
  otoacoustic ear tones (Amacher).
- Multi-output scores: one command writes the audio AND its spectrogram/video.
  The piece is audiovisual by construction.
